# Defense in depth: never make credential-shaped files Git-visible merely
# because somebody puts them outside the canonical ignored runtime trees.
**/*-key.pem
**/*.key
**/id_ed25519
**/id_ed25519_*
**/ssh_host_*_key
**/authorized_keys
**/known_hosts*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/credentials/**
**/secrets/**
